F. Section 3: J.E from the Lorentz force; the four-situation table
====================================================================================================
PASS  power density rho(E + u x B).u = rho E.u = J.E (magnetic part does no work, np.cross)
PASS  ohmic: J.E = sigma E^2 = J^2/sigma >= 0

