L. Section 7: time averages by quadrature, and the same averages by 1/2 Re{A B*} (independent route)
====================================================================================================
PASS  <cos^2(wt+phi)> = <sin^2(wt+phi)> = 1/2, <cos(wt+phi)> = 0, <sin wt cos wt> = 0 (any phi, any start time)
