PASS  general sheet J0 cos wt in impedance eta: <S> = eta J0^2/8 per side, <-J_s.E> = eta J0^2/4
PASS  time-averaged theorem for the slab |z| < d: average outflow = eta0 for every d
PASS  notes' example: <w> = eta0/(2c) = 6.3e-7 J/m^3 on each side (= 1/2 eps0 eta0^2)

